{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>日本牛壇盛事《第43屆最襯牛仔褲名人》頒獎禮，昨日(18日)假東京舉行。當紅男團Snow Man主將目黑蓮與24歲女星生見愛瑠，分別成為由市民票選的「一般部門」得主。</p><p>目黑蓮以白T恤襯牛仔褲的簡單造型示人，已是連續第3年捧獎的他，將接棒同門師兄木村拓哉，打入殿堂獲封「牛王」。韓團MEOVV的日籍成員ANNA則成特別獎得主。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T16:44:39.436081+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":170,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T16:01:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T21:49:03.801575+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T16:37:47.925429+00:00","content_hash":"f3d9c6b8c0b25bd39e66b1e372e6ea942fc8c0af2bf4597ba1d082952a053b10","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-18T16:44:39.436081+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}